    "# Direct synthesis of dimethyl ether from synthesis gas\n",
    "\n",
    "Source: *Direct synthesis of dimethyl ether from synthesis gas: Experimental study and mathematical modeling* (Chemical Engineering Journal, 2017, DOI: 10.1016/j.cej.2017.04.132) [web:13].\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook summarizes only information explicitly available from the paper abstract and searchable metadata [web:13]."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Reaction system\n",
    "\n",
    "The paper studies direct DME synthesis from syngas using a bifunctional catalyst system [web:13].\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Methanol synthesis: `CO + 2H2 <-> CH3OH`\n",
    "2. Methanol dehydration: `2CH3OH <-> CH3OCH3 + H2O`\n",
    "3. Overall: `2CO + 4H2 <-> CH3OCH3 + H2O`\n",
    "\n",
    "The paper reports thermodynamic analysis over **10–100 bar**, **220–280 °C**, and **H2/CO = 1–6** [web:13]."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Optimal reaction conditions\n",
    "\n",
    "For loading variant **2:1:2**, the paper reports the following optimal conditions [web:13]:\n",
    "\n",
    "| Parameter | Value |\n",
    "|---|---:|\n",
    "| Pressure | 30 bar |\n",
    "| Temperature | 280 °C |\n",
    "| Initial H2/CO ratio | 2 |\n",
    "| Catalyst loading variant | 2:1:2 |\n",
    "\n",
    "The paper also states that CO conversion remains practically constant during a 180 h run under these conditions [web:13]."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from dataclasses import dataclass\n",
    "\n",
    "@dataclass\n",
    "class ConditionSet:\n",
    "    pressure_bar: float\n",
    "    temperature_c: float\n",
    "    h2_co_ratio: float\n",
    "    loading_variant: str\n",
    "\n",
    "optimal = ConditionSet(pressure_bar=30, temperature_c=280, h2_co_ratio=2, loading_variant='2:1:2')\n",
    "optimal"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Reaction depiction\n",
    "\n",
    "The scheme below depicts the two-step direct DME synthesis route used in the paper [web:13]."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(12, 3))\n",
    "ax.axis('off')\n",
    "\n",
    "text = (\n",
    "    r'$CO + 2H_2 \\leftrightarrow CH_3OH$' '\\n'\n",
    "    r'$2CH_3OH \\leftrightarrow CH_3OCH_3 + H_2O$' '\\n'\n",
    "    r'Overall: $2CO + 4H_2 \\leftrightarrow CH_3OCH_3 + H_2O$'\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "ax.text(0.02, 0.5, text, fontsize=16, va='center')\n",
    "fig.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "fig.savefig('reaction_depiction.png', dpi=200, bbox_inches='tight')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
